ecute_input":"2026-07-21T09:04:08.43513Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-07-21T09:04:08.51815Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-07-21T09:04:08.435094Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-07-21T09:04:08.517342Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Creating knowledge base...\nKnowledge base created with 2000 documents.\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":37},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Building the FAISS Index\n\nThe knowledge base documents are converted into dense vector embeddings using the Sentence Transformer model. These embeddings are then indexed using FAISS, enabling efficient similarity search during retrieval.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"print(\"Creating document embeddings...\")\n\nkb_embeddings = embedding_model.encode(\n    kb,\n    convert_to_numpy=True,\n    show_progress_bar=True\n)\n\nprint(\"Building FAISS index...\")\n\nindex = faiss.IndexFlatL2(kb_embeddings.shape[1])\nindex.add(kb_embeddings)\n\nprint(f\"Indexed {index.ntotal} documents.\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-07-21T09:04:08.519255Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-07-21T09:04:08.520008Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-07-21T09:04:09.470478Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-07-21T09:04:08.519983Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-07-21T09:04:09.46989Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Creating document embeddings...\n","output_type":"stream"},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"Batches:   0%|          | 0/63 [00:00<?, ?it/s]","application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json":{"version_major":2,"version_minor":0,"model_id":"f5b016a6dc504b03a0bd81125e1aefcf"}},"metadata":{}},{"name":"stdout","text":"Building FAISS index...\nIndexed 2000 documents.\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":38},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Dense Retrieval using FAISS\n\nGiven a question, we first generate its embedding using the Sentence Transformer model. The embedding is then used to query the FAISS index, retrieving the t