oss     : {val_loss:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Validation Accuracy : {val_accuracy:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Validation AUC      : {val_auc:.4f}\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-07-21T09:12:38.134109Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-07-21T09:12:38.134676Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-07-21T09:12:38.694214Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-07-21T09:12:38.134649Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-07-21T09:12:38.693538Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"\u001b[1m63/63\u001b[0m \u001b[32m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[0m \u001b[1m1s\u001b[0m 8ms/step - accuracy: 0.9980 - auc: 1.0000 - loss: 0.0058\n\nValidation Loss     : 0.0058\nValidation Accuracy : 0.9980\nValidation AUC      : 1.0000\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":64},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## Validation MAP@3 Evaluation\n\nAlthough the BiLSTM model is trained using Binary Cross-Entropy Loss, the competition evaluates predictions using Mean Average Precision at 3 (MAP@3).\n\nTo estimate competition performance, the model is evaluated on the validation set by:\n\n1. Predicting probabilities for all five answer options.\n2. Ranking the options according to predicted probability.\n3. Comparing the top three predictions with the correct answer.\n4. Computing the Mean Average Precision at 3 (MAP@3).\n\nThis provides a better estimate of competition performance than accuracy alone.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# # ==========================================================\n# # Validation MAP@3\n# # ==========================================================\n\n# # Predict probabilities on the validation set\n# val_scores = model.predict(\n#     tf.constant(X_val_tf, dtype=tf.string),\n#     batch_size=32,\n#     verbose=1\n# ).flatten()\n\n# # Group every 5 option scores\n# val_rankings = []\n\n# for i in range(0, len(val_scores), 5):\n#     scores = val_scores[i:i+5]\n#     ranked = np.argsort(scores)[::-1]\n#     val_rankings.append(ranked)\n\n#